{"page":37,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:231","surah":2,"ayah":231,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا طَلَّقْتُمُ ٱلنِّسَآءَ فَبَلَغْنَ أَجَلَهُنَّ فَأَمْسِكُوهُنَّ بِمَعْرُوفٍ أَوْ سَرِّحُوهُنَّ بِمَعْرُوفٍ ۚ وَلَا تُمْسِكُوهُنَّ ضِرَارًا لِّتَعْتَدُوا۟ ۚ وَمَن يَفْعَلْ ذَٰلِكَ فَقَدْ ظَلَمَ نَفْسَهُۥ ۚ وَلَا تَتَّخِذُوٓا۟ ءَايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ هُزُوًا ۚ وَٱذْكُرُوا۟ نِعْمَتَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْكُمْ وَمَآ أَنزَلَ عَلَيْكُم مِّنَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ وَٱلْحِكْمَةِ يَعِظُكُم بِهِۦ ۚ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When you divorce women and they have reached their set time, then either keep or release them in a fair manner. Do not hold on to them with intent to harm them and commit aggression: anyone who does this wrongs himself. Do not make a mockery of God’s revelations; remember the favour He blessed you with, and the Scripture and wisdom He sent to teach you. Be mindful of God and know that He has full knowledge of everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":2,"ar":"طَلَّقْتُمُ","en_gloss":"you divorce","transliteration":"ṭallaqtumu","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنِّسَآءَ","en_gloss":"the women","transliteration":"l-nisāa","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَبَلَغْنَ","en_gloss":"and they reach","transliteration":"fabalaghna","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَجَلَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their (waiting) term","transliteration":"ajalahunna","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأَمْسِكُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"then retain them","transliteration":"fa-amsikūhunna","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِمَعْرُوفٍ","en_gloss":"in a fair manner","transliteration":"bimaʿrūfin","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَرِّحُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"release them","transliteration":"sarriḥūhunna","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِمَعْرُوفٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"in a fair manner","transliteration":"bimaʿrūfin","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تُمْسِكُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"retain them","transliteration":"tum'sikūhunna","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ضِرَارًۭا","en_gloss":"(to) hurt","transliteration":"ḍirāran","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِّتَعْتَدُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"so that you transgress","transliteration":"litaʿtadū","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَفْعَلْ","en_gloss":"does","transliteration":"yafʿal","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ظَلَمَ","en_gloss":"he wronged","transliteration":"ẓalama","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":20,"ar":"نَفْسَهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"himself","transliteration":"nafsahu","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":22,"ar":"تَتَّخِذُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"take","transliteration":"tattakhidhū","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(the) Verses","transliteration":"āyāti","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":25,"ar":"هُزُوًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"(in) jest","transliteration":"huzuwan","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَٱذْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and remember","transliteration":"wa-udh'kurū","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":27,"ar":"نِعْمَتَ","en_gloss":"(the) Favors","transliteration":"niʿ'mata","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":28,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":29,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":30,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":31,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"(is) revealed","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":32,"ar":"عَلَيْكُم","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":33,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":34,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":35,"ar":"وَٱلْحِكْمَةِ","en_gloss":"and [the] wisdom","transliteration":"wal-ḥik'mati","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":36,"ar":"يَعِظُكُم","en_gloss":"He instructs you","transliteration":"yaʿiẓukum","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":37,"ar":"بِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":38,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"And fear","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":39,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":40,"ar":"وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and know","transliteration":"wa-iʿ'lamū","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":41,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":42,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah (is)","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":43,"ar":"بِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"of every","transliteration":"bikulli","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":44,"ar":"شَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":45,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"2:231"},{"pos":46,"ar":"٢٣١","en_gloss":"(231)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:231"}]},{"verse_key":"2:232","surah":2,"ayah":232,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا طَلَّقْتُمُ ٱلنِّسَآءَ فَبَلَغْنَ أَجَلَهُنَّ فَلَا تَعْضُلُوهُنَّ أَن يَنكِحْنَ أَزْوَٰجَهُنَّ إِذَا تَرَٰضَوْا۟ بَيْنَهُم بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ ۗ ذَٰلِكَ يُوعَظُ بِهِۦ مَن كَانَ مِنكُمْ يُؤْمِنُ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۗ ذَٰلِكُمْ أَزْكَىٰ لَكُمْ وَأَطْهَرُ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ وَأَنتُمْ لَا تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When you divorce women and they have reached their set time, do not prevent them from remarrying their husbands if they both agree to do so in a fair manner. Let those of you who believe in God and the Last Day take this to heart: that is more wholesome and purer for you. God knows and you do not.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":2,"ar":"طَلَّقْتُمُ","en_gloss":"you divorce","transliteration":"ṭallaqtumu","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنِّسَآءَ","en_gloss":"[the] women","transliteration":"l-nisāa","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَبَلَغْنَ","en_gloss":"and they reached","transliteration":"fabalaghna","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَجَلَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their (waiting) term","transliteration":"ajalahunna","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَعْضُلُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"hinder them","transliteration":"taʿḍulūhunna","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَنكِحْنَ","en_gloss":"(from) marrying","transliteration":"yankiḥ'na","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَزْوَٰجَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their husbands","transliteration":"azwājahunna","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَرَٰضَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they agree","transliteration":"tarāḍaw","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَيْنَهُم","en_gloss":"between themselves","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ ۗ","en_gloss":"in a fair manner","transliteration":"bil-maʿrūfi","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُوعَظُ","en_gloss":"is admonished","transliteration":"yūʿaẓu","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":19,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"[is]","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُ","en_gloss":"believes","transliteration":"yu'minu","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":22,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":23,"ar":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","en_gloss":"and the Day","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۗ","en_gloss":"[the] Last","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālikum","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":26,"ar":"أَزْكَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) more virtuous","transliteration":"azkā","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":27,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":28,"ar":"وَأَطْهَرُ ۗ","en_gloss":"and more purer","transliteration":"wa-aṭharu","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":29,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":30,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":31,"ar":"وَأَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"and you","transliteration":"wa-antum","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":32,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":33,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"2:232"},{"pos":34,"ar":"٢٣٢","en_gloss":"(232)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:232"}]},{"verse_key":"2:233","surah":2,"ayah":233,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَٱلْوَٰلِدَٰتُ يُرْضِعْنَ أَوْلَـٰدَهُنَّ حَوْلَيْنِ كَامِلَيْنِ ۖ لِمَنْ أَرَادَ أَن يُتِمَّ ٱلرَّضَاعَةَ ۚ وَعَلَى ٱلْمَوْلُودِ لَهُۥ رِزْقُهُنَّ وَكِسْوَتُهُنَّ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ ۚ لَا تُكَلَّفُ نَفْسٌ إِلَّا وُسْعَهَا ۚ لَا تُضَآرَّ وَٰلِدَةٌۢ بِوَلَدِهَا وَلَا مَوْلُودٌ لَّهُۥ بِوَلَدِهِۦ ۚ وَعَلَى ٱلْوَارِثِ مِثْلُ ذَٰلِكَ ۗ فَإِنْ أَرَادَا فِصَالًا عَن تَرَاضٍ مِّنْهُمَا وَتَشَاوُرٍ فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْهِمَا ۗ وَإِنْ أَرَدتُّمْ أَن تَسْتَرْضِعُوٓا۟ أَوْلَـٰدَكُمْ فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْكُمْ إِذَا سَلَّمْتُم مَّآ ءَاتَيْتُم بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ ۗ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَصِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Mothers suckle their children for two whole years, if they wish to complete the term, and clothing and maintenance must be borne by the father in a fair manner. No one should be burdened with more than they can bear: no mother shall be made to suffer harm on account of her child, nor any father on account of his. The same duty is incumbent on the father’s heir. If, by mutual consent and consultation, the couple wish to wean [the child], they will not be blamed, nor will there be any blame if you wish to engage a wet nurse, provided you pay as agreed in a fair manner. Be mindful of God, knowing that He sees everything you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَٱلْوَٰلِدَٰتُ","en_gloss":"And the mothers","transliteration":"wal-wālidātu","verse_key":"2:233"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُرْضِعْنَ","en_gloss":"shall suckle","transliteration":"yur'ḍiʿ'na","verse_key":"2:233"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَوْلَـٰدَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their children","transliteration":"awlādahunna","verse_key":"2:233"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حَوْلَيْنِ","en_gloss":"(for) two years","transliteration":"ḥawlayni","verse_key":"2:233"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَامِلَيْنِ ۖ","en_gloss":"complete","transliteration":"kāmilayni","verse_key":"2:233"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِمَنْ","en_gloss":"for whoever","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"2:233"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَرَادَ","en_gloss":"wishes","transliteration":"arāda","verse_key":"2:233"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:233"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُتِمَّ","en_gloss":"complete","transliteration":"yutimma","verse_key":"2:233"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلرَّضَاعَةَ ۚ","en_gloss":"the suckling","transliterati